OL,3,GNEWSAMulti-vehicle crash closes main
OL,4,Aroute overnight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA collision involving 16 cars forced
OL,7,Fthe closure of a busy route overnight.
OL,9,FThe incident happened in fog on the
OL,10,FA303 near Thruxton, Hampshire, shortly
OL,11,Fafter 20:20 BST on Saturday.
OL,13,FSouth Central Ambulance Service (SCAS)
OL,14,Fsaid at least eight people suffered
OL,15,Fminor injuries and one person with a
OL,16,Fbroken arm was taken to hospital by
OL,17,Ffamily members.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
