OL,3,GNEWSAMulti-vehicle crash closes main
OL,4,Aroute overnight
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vehicles were recovered but
OL,7,FNational Highways said a "significant"
OL,8,Foil spillage required extensive
OL,9,Fspecialist cleaning. The route
OL,10,Feventually reopened at about 13:15 GMT
OL,11,Fon Sunday.
